# Web Testing

- **Unit / component / hook tests**: **Vitest** + **Testing Library**.
- **End-to-end**: **Playwright**, reserved for the money-and-trust journeys a school can't tolerate breaking: login, admission form, fee payment, viewing results.

> Favor many fast component tests and a focused, small set of E2E tests. Don't recreate full E2E coverage for logic that a component/unit test can verify faster.
